abstract: >-
  BioDYM is a comprehensive Material Flow Analysis (MFA) tool designed for
  analyzing bio-based material systems. Built on the ODYM framework, it tracks
  material flows, stocks, and transformations through time with special features
  for organic waste management and biomass cascading. The tool supports dynamic
  stock modeling (DSM), first-order mineralization processes (FOMP), Monte Carlo
  uncertainty analysis, and multi-element tracking.
